    <string name="licences_licence_head">Licence</string>
    <string name="licences_licence">Practice is free software: GPL-3.0-only, copyright wander wildwood. What it is built on keeps its own licences, listed below.</string>
    <string name="licences_built_head">Built with</string>
    <string name="licences_back">Back</string>
    <string name="about_no_browser_address">No browser is installed. The address is %1$s.</string>
    <string name="about_what_head">Practice</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_head">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">This app collects nothing and sends nothing anywhere: it has no internet permission. Your habits, ticks, the log of sittings with any notes, and its settings stay in its own private storage on the phone; uninstalling removes them, and the app is not included in phone backups. Save a backup writes them as one file only where you choose, when you press it. Its permissions are for the bells only: exact alarms so they ring on time, a foreground service and wake lock so they ring with the screen off, a notification while a sitting is under way, and, only if you switch it on, Do Not Disturb access to set alarms only during a sitting. There are no ads, no analytics and no tracking.</string>
